Z||000001||fiero56||03-26-2000||06:42 PM||||I don't think it will be possible to salvage it. You could tap some new threads in, but I doubt you will be able to find a bleeder valve that would fit a larger opening.<BR>Try carparts.com and see what pricing you can find.||||reg||1
Z||000002||theogre||03-26-2000||10:02 PM||||If you meen the banjo bolt like I think you do. Replace the caliper. <P>Bleeder screws can be drilled tapped and an oversize bleeder used as ling as you don't trash the bleeder seat. Really needs be done with a drill press so the depth can be controlled.||||reg||1
